  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "RayCo4D enables monocular 4D dynamic reconstruction while Joints, Camera, Action! co-generates 3D motion and video for arbitrary rigs, and Scene-R1 provides video-grounded 3D scene reasoning with lightweight annotations. CapDepth addresses the challenge of non-Lambertian surfaces by leveraging detailed long captions and dynamic caption encoding to enhance robustness, while also incorporating random tone-mapping augmentation to improve lighting adaptability. RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging.",
